  "content": "<p>你是否曾想过驾驶属于自己的火车？你是否曾建造过一座拥有火车站的城市，并心想“如果这座火车站有真正的火车和真实的人，那该多棒啊”？这个整合包让你能够借助朋友们的帮助实现所有这些想法！这是我们服务器“Traincraft”所使用的整合包。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果你想加入我们的服务器，请访问以下网站并提交申请：<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/servers/pc-servers/2638729-minecraft-traincraft-server-1-7-10-latest-version#c1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traincraft 服务器论坛</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>模组列表：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/245169\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traincraft (by Mrbrutal)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/51195\" rel=\"nofollow\">Railcraft (by CovertJaguar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/61811\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildcraft (by CovertJaguar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/233140\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildcraft Compat (by buildcraftchildsplay)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/222995\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eureka (by AEnterprise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/221014\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildcraft Additions (by AEnterprise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/235279\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel (by tterrag1098)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/74924\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mantle (by mDiyo)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/74072\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers Construct (by mDiyo)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225561\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Utilities (by RWTema)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/228756\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests (by progwml6)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/221857\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's HarvestCraft (by MatrexsVigil)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223094\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tweaks (by Kobata)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curs